WEBVTT

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.350
Finally, a day off.  Maybe I should just go back to sleep.

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:31.570
It's so nice out today.

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:35.360
All right! Up and at 'em!

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.140
Need to do laundry today!

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:47.500
It feels so nice!

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:54.030
What's that!?

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:32.080
Are you awake, Miya!?

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:35.000
Oh, hey,  Yunocchi. Mornin'.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.300
'Sup?

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:41.720
There's this weird lumpy thing in the back yard...

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:42.760
It's all scraggly...

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.450
Huh? In the back yard?

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:51.150
Listen! It's making weird noises now!

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:53.150
Oh, that must be Hiro.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:54.750
Hiro!?

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:57.310
Maybe she's sleepwalking.

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:00.150
It's yawning!

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:02.780
What are you doing, Hiro?

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:10.150
Oh, the weather's so wonderful today that I decided to wash my curtains.

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:15.680
I came out here to wash them in the yard with the tub from the shed,

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:19.880
but it wasn't big enough, and now I don't know what to do...

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:24.410
Oh, hey, Miya, do you still have that kiddie pool?

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.700
Lemme borrow it!

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:27.520
Sure, fine.

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:55.710
Oh, you're washing your curtains?

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:59.640
Yeah. The old tub wasn't big enough.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:03.490
So why not wash them in the bathtub?

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:11.190
Mind if I get something from your room?

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:12.310
Oh, sure, I guess.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:23.070
What are they up to?

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:26.720
Oh, Nori and Nazuna!

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:28.550
We're washing our curtains.

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:30.200
Would you like to too?

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.840
Laundry?

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:35.920
We just bought ours, so we should be fine.

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:39.550
Curtain... Just currently bought 'em...

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:43.840
No one would get it! It's not even all that good!

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.380
What's wrong, Nori?

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:51.810
Wow, look at how dirty the water's getting!

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:55.110
Really? I thought I kept them cleaner than that...

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:59.270
Must be dust and stuff. I'm surprised there's that much.

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:02.530
We never notice going about our daily lives,

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:08.120
but little by little, they get this dirty...

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:12.050
Nazuna, when you get all serious like that...

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:14.990
It really sounds like you're talking about something else...

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:24.610
Sae! Hiro! Can I help Miya?

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:27.130
Go right ahead! Thanks!

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:30.370
It's chilly!

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:31.950
Welcome!

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:35.750
I wonder if this is what stomping grapes feels like?

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:39.750
It makes me think of making udon.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.280
They're so close.

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:53.000
You haven't eaten breakfast yet, have you?

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.150
Maybe I should fix you some toast.

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:56.750
Yay!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:59.670
I'll go fry some eggs!

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:03.170
Wait, do I have enough eggs?

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:06.040
I have a few, you can use mine.

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:06.630
Okay!

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:11.700
Oh no.

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:19.300
I made enough for everyone, so, um...

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:22.110
That doesn't look very appetizing...

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:28.980
And Nazuna brought the ham!

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:32.200
What an amazing breakfast!

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.870
Let's eat!

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.450
Here, Miya.

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:39.020
Oh, sorry.

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:41.170
Silly Miya.

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:42.880
That was tasty.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.800
Thanks for the food.

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:48.640
I love 'em soft-boiled!

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:51.340
Yeah, with the yolk just runny enough.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:53.140
These came out great, Yuno.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:54.430
Thanks!

00:06:57.860 --> 00:06:59.890
Here comes the detergent!

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.860
It's all bubbly!

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:11.470
Wow, Miya!

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:14.740
Hey, I have an idea!

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:18.660
Here, I got a straw and a paper cup!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:19.660
Here!

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:21.130
Thanks!

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:34.140
Look, shaved ice!

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:36.290
It looks just like the real thing.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:42.260
That's pretty.

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:43.760
Soar!

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:49.280
Oh my.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:53.890
Good morning!

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:56.800
Good morning!

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:59.870
Are you blowing bubbles today?

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.370
No, that's not it.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:04.120
We're washing our curtains.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:05.330
Oh!

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:10.540
They looked clean, but they were really pretty dirty!

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:13.300
You know, you look like your clothes could use a wash too.

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:15.680
We'd be glad to do it for you!

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:19.140
I am still pure white!

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:26.200
So, are you going out? That's a really cute dress.

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:27.920
Thanks!

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:32.900
I'm going to go help a friend pick out her wedding dress!

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:34.070
So...

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:35.910
So?

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:40.910
I've got a date, so I've got to get going!

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:44.800
If I try on any cute wedding dresses, I'll be sure to send you pictures!

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.400
Wait, you're trying them on?

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:55.520
She doesn't really have a use for one of those, does she?

00:08:56.110 --> 00:09:00.180
Nothing wrong with settling down a bit later.

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:08.560
Washing's done, ma'am!

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:09.900
We're done!

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.770
Thanks! Good work!

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:16.360
Now let's dry--Wow, that's heavy!

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:19.500
Wow, they get heavy when they're wet.

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:20.870
Oh well, if it's this heavy...

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:26.370
There's nothing we can do but wring it out!

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:31.860
Huh? Hiro?

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:34.580
Er...!

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:39.240
What's wrong, Nazuna? You're never normally this loud.

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:43.180
Why don't we take the curtains inside for now?

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:46.030
Huh, why?

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:49.270
I didn't mention it, bu--

00:09:53.900 --> 00:10:00.830
I heard the forecast this morning, but you were already soaking the curtains, so...

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:04.200
Don't worry, It's not your fault.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.120
Now what do we do?

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:11.670
You can't really dry something this big inside.

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:14.510
I dunno, maybe we can.

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:16.760
Where? How?

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.220
Can...

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:24.850
Can you even call that drying?

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.540
Will it dry out?

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:32.620
Hurry! Hurry!

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:37.150
Wow, I'm already soaked!

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:40.530
A natural shower! Maybe I should wash my hair.

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:43.880
You should change or you'll catch cold!

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:47.490
'Kay. See you later, Yunocchi.

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:49.010
See you!

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:54.380
I'm sopping wet from the rain.

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:58.970
Maybe I should just take a bath.

00:11:05.690 --> 00:11:07.560
Bubbles!

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:13.820
That felt great!

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:18.680
I guess that washed off some dirt I couldn't see...

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:49.640
Ms. Yoshinoya! Planning time is already over!

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:55.890
The other teachers have already gone to homeroom.

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:58.170
Your students are waiting!

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:00.070
I'll be right there!

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:04.770
I'm sorry, I just dozed off after lunch...

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.900
If you keep eating and sleeping, you're going to turn into a cow.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:09.110
A cow!?

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:14.250
Ms. Kuwahara! You're so mean!

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.420
Principal!

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:26.780
Are you okay, Principal!?

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:30.370
I'm fine. Ms. Yoshinoya...

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:33.220
I am not a cow!

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:38.980
I hadn't even said anything yet...

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:44.680
I am not a cow!

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:46.260
Good afternoon!

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:49.160
I mean, I know I'm curvy, but...

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:52.020
Hmm, maybe a milk cow?

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:54.570
Wait, no!

00:12:57.520 --> 00:13:00.080
No one even said anything.

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:02.050
I wonder where she went?

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:04.130
Does this mean we can leave now?

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:18.070
And did she, like, not come back?

00:13:18.070 --> 00:13:22.480
No, the principal brought her back in right away.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.030
What's her problem?

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:30.740
Oh, it's the landlady!

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:32.720
Oh, hey, you're back!

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:34.290
And all together, huh.

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:35.410
Landlady!

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:36.630
What's up?

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:40.510
She wants to take us all out for all-you-can-eat yakiniku!

00:13:40.510 --> 00:13:43.070
She says it's her treat!

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:47.180
What are you all making that face for?

00:13:52.850 --> 00:14:00.370
Before you and Nazuna moved in, she had us clean rooms 103 and 203.

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:02.230
Oh, really?

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:04.910
We had to wash the floors and scrub the kitchens.

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:07.860
It took us all day, but it was fun!

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:09.530
I never knew!

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:13.970
She brought us takeout back then.

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:17.710
If she's offering all-you-can-eat yakiniku now...

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:21.260
She's reformed!?

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:23.210
I know you're all a bit shocked, but...

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:24.720
Ow!

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:32.180
Jeez, I just made a bit extra at the job I picked up last month so I thought I'd share it with you girls for once!

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:35.020
Show some appreciation! I'm taking you out for all-you-can-eat!

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:36.290
All I can eat?

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:40.560
If you get tired of the yakiniku there's sushi and cake and stuff too.

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:41.500
Cake too?

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.070
Oh wow!

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:48.310
Aren't you excited, Miya?

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:52.180
I am, but...

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:56.340
I'm suspicious about what the restaurant gets out of the deal...

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:00.770
And we're here!

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.790
We've got 100 minutes!

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:10.660
'Kay!

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:14.560
I have to pay for anything you don't finish, so clean plates, girls!

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:15.410
Sure!

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:17.770
All right, go for it!

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:19.640
Yeah!

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:26.900
I can't decide what to have first!

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:28.190
I'm having pudding!

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:32.160
Huh?

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:33.740
Cheers!

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:38.060
This is great!

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:39.860
What did you all get to drink?

00:15:39.860 --> 00:15:41.910
I got Calpis!

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:42.920
Coke for me!

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:47.940
C'mon, c'mon. I don't care if you don't drink, first one's gotta be a beer when you go out.

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:50.390
They're underage!

00:15:50.390 --> 00:15:52.760
Jeez, I was just joking.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:54.760
You're always so serious, Sae.

00:15:56.150 --> 00:15:59.090
I always start with the tongue!

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:01.590
C'mon, I got enough for everyone!

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:02.600
Okay!

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:06.670
Tongue... Beef tongue, right?

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:08.900
Yeah. Yuno, have you ever had it before?

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:12.580
We used to do this all the time at home.

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:16.120
Cow tongues are so thin!

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:19.920
It's... not really like that...

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.450
This's tasty!

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:25.830
The ribs and the chuck roast are both super-tasty!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:31.370
Y'know, I haven't the foggiest which are the ribs and what's the roast.

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:32.720
Really?

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:38.320
The roast is up here by the head, while the ribs are down more in the ribcage.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.870
Man, yakiniku's awesome.

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:48.800
All the meat I can eat. This is heaven.

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:52.740
What?

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:59.270
Landlady, you're not having anything but meat.

00:16:59.270 --> 00:17:02.160
Isn't that a waste?

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:07.960
Someday you'll understand that you're the ones really wasting your time.

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:13.110
Sushi, sushi!

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:21.890
I, the owner of Hidamari Apartments, present you with...

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.810
Sushian Roulette!

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:24.760
Sushian...

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:26.030
Roulette?

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:29.440
Let me explain.

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:34.030
One of these pieces of sushi is just paaaaaacked with wasabi.

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:37.820
The girl who picks it has to do the weeding at Hidamari Apartments and my place!

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:41.530
Wait, I get Hidamari Apartments, but your place too?

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:44.260
Oh no! Wasabi's too hot for me!

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:46.930
Too much makes my nose twitch.

00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:49.100
I hope I don't get it...

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:52.050
Can I pass on this game?

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:57.370
Remember, guys, today's my treat.

00:17:57.370 --> 00:17:59.050
C'mon, take one!

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:06.430
En garde!

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:14.940
The sushi's great!

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.990
Mine was fine too!

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:20.800
You got it?

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:22.740
Are you okay?

00:18:26.090 --> 00:18:27.950
So it was me...

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:35.170
Hoist on my own petard, huh?

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:38.560
Aren't I just such a risk-taker?

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:42.110
Wonderful, you'll be taking care of the lawn.

00:18:42.110 --> 00:18:42.510
... Yes.

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:50.900
Sae, let's split all five kinds of cake. I want to try them all.

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:52.190
Sure.

00:18:53.970 --> 00:18:58.250
They're tiny pieces, are you sure you don't just want to have them all to yourself?

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:00.150
I dunno...

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:05.370
I was planning on going back for seconds and thirds of my favorite.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.450
Oh.

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:09.890
Sae, you're being used.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:14.630
That was great!

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:16.080
Wasn't it?

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:17.880
That will be 21,000 yen.

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:21.000
Huh? I thought it was 3,000 each.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:23.330
It should be 18,000 for six.

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:24.380
Six?

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:26.040
What about you?

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:29.750
Can each of you spot me a fiver?

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:31.140
Okay.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:36.150
Oh, they gave us gum.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.490
Thanks!

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:42.290
Nothing like a good smoke after some yakiniku.

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:43.990
Where are my smokes?

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:46.760
I thought you quit.

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:50.080
Oh, right. Gotta hold back, then.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:52.330
Why'd you quit?

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:54.440
Well, y'know.

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:59.590
I figured I'd lay off until you guys passed your exams.

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:01.250
Landlady...

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:02.630
She's lying.

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:08.770
That was great! Thanks!

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:16.230
Man, I don't wanna walk all the way home. Mind if I crash here?

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:18.530
You want to stay at Hidamari Apartments?

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.100
All right, rock-paper-scissors.

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:26.100
This is how they treat me after I buy them dinner?

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:37.790
Honey, I'm home!

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.770
Wow, the place looks great!

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:48.300
Sit right down over here.

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:50.910
Really, I'll pass.

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:53.450
Oh, hey, your uniform!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:58.880
I wonder if I could still fit into one of these?

00:20:58.880 --> 00:20:59.370
Wait--

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:02.190
This smells great!

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:03.990
You don't even put anything on it, do you?

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:06.070
Is that just how a schoolgirl smells?

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:10.870
Did you just hear something?

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:12.330
Yeah, I guess.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:14.790
I'm home.

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:18.840
I'm stuffed.

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:20.620
We ate way too much.

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:23.200
I'm gonna go weigh myself.

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:24.420
Now!?

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:26.380
Miya, you've sure got guts...

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:30.010
You haven't weighed yourself in a week, right?

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:32.140
Yeah. I wonder if I've gotten bigger,

00:21:34.210 --> 00:21:36.790
I'm a whole three kilos bigger!

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:38.630
And that makes you happy!?

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:50.830
Maybe I can sweat it off...

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:58.210
No! I'll make myself faint!

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:03.420
Please let that make me taller...

00:22:03.790 --> 00:22:05.730
Please...
